class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,T\\in V\">\\(\\rho,T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8WellFoundedTree}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8WellFoundedTree}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"89f48d4d04da27ae\" href=\"?note=89f48d4d04da27ae\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10WellfoundedTreeRank}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10WellfoundedTreeRank}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}wellfounded\\text{-}tree\\text{-}rank}\n\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10WellfoundedTreeRank}_S(\\rho,T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8WellFoundedTree}_S(T)\n\\land\n\\exists\\gamma\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,T,\\gamma)\n\\land\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\rho(t)=\\bigcup\\{\\rho(u)\\cup\\{\\rho(u)\\}\\mid u\\in T\\land t\\subsetneq u\\}\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}wellfounded\\text{-}tree\\text{-}rank}\n\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10WellfoundedTreeRank}_S(\\rho,T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8WellFoundedTree}_S(T)\n\\land\n\\exists\\gamma\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,T,\\gamma)\n\\land\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\rho(t)=\\bigcup\\{\\rho(u)\\cup\\{\\rho(u)\\}\\mid u\\in T\\land t\\subsetneq u\\}\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The range-bound ordinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span> keeps the rank function set-valued while the recursive equation fixes its values uniquely.</li>\n<li>This definition is independent of the downstream tree-rank alias and therefore introduces no dependency cycle.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"89f48d4d04da27ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"89f48d4d04da27ae","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8WellFoundedTree}_S\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\rho,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8WellFoundedTree}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10WellfoundedTreeRank}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}wellfounded\\text{-}tree\\text{-}rank}\n\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10WellfoundedTreeRank}_S(\\rho,T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8WellFoundedTree}_S(T)\n\\land\n\\exists\\gamma\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,T,\\gamma)\n\\land\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\rho(t)=\\bigcup\\{\\rho(u)\\cup\\{\\rho(u)\\}\\mid u\\in T\\land t\\subsetneq u\\}\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false}],"bytes":1547,"backlinks":[{"id":"91f853557651cacc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree10WellfoundedTreeRank}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeRank}_S\\subseteq V^2$（见 [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree10-wellfounded-tree-rank.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3781","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tre